            "review_title": "Review at Bar Deja Vu",
            "review_text": "Olivia Nguyen\nLondon, United Kingdom8 contributions\n0\nFabulous experience with personal cocktails for myself\nJul 2018 • Solo\nWill never forget 2 special cocktails made by Mr.Lap, a talented bartender there. He not only made cocktails but also told me stories about them and how each ingredient related to events in my life, which could be called Emotion-inspired cocktails. ISN\"T IT AMAZING?????????He really connected me to those drinks and to the ambiance too. \n\nAnother cool thing about my cocktails was there were some hand-made and unique ingredients such as Sweetened Oven dried orange slice, dried chamomile flowers and especially chamomile tea !!!!!! So Cool !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 8, 2018",
