            "review_text": "fiorella_nguyen\nSingapore, Singapore87 contributions\n0\nGreats service, big area\nDec 2015 • Couples\nI like this bar, the customer service (Sheraton Hanoi) is top notch. Good drinks, a full bar plus the kitchen is open till 9/10pm. The food is really good, the wine is good as well and the price is not ridiculously expensive. \n\nThere is a big TV screen playing music, a pool table (in decent shape) and comfy chairs to sit and lounge around. Definitely recommend checking this place out if you stay in the hotel.\nRead more\nWritten December 30, 2015",
